  "text": "## Estimated Timeline\n\nDevelopment schedules vary based on app features and backend complexity:\n\n- **Focused Mobile Application (e.g., Ordering / Portal App)**: 6 to 10 weeks from discovery to store release.\n- **Full-Featured Consumer / SaaS Mobile App**: 10 to 16 weeks from discovery to store release.\n- **Complex Multi-Role Mobile Platform**: 16 to 24 weeks from discovery to store release.\n\n---",
